WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:01.520
Your Majesty

00:02.560 --> 00:04.640
The rebels have reached the city walls

00:04.720 --> 00:06.000
They say

00:06.080 --> 00:06.320
This

00:06.400 --> 00:06.960
What do they say?

00:07.040 --> 00:07.720
They only want

00:07.800 --> 00:10.640
To purge the court and correct the ruler's hearing

00:10.720 --> 00:12.387
These are their peace terms

00:27.400 --> 00:28.760
How outrageous
